  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzVVUizs0mk_GCbYdht9s1pMAd7O0--55i2FjhQZQkBL80kk0EDvMSRyddJhYfvyUAi0Q/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzVVUizs0mk_GCbYdht9s1pMAd7O0--55i2FjhQZQkBL80kk0EDvMSRyddJhYfvyUAi0Q/exec</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"서울시 대기환경 통합 정보\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzVVUizs0mk_GCbYdht9s1pMAd7O0--55i2FjhQZQkBL80kk0EDvMSRyddJhYfvyUAi0Q/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzVVUizs0mk_GCbYdht9s1pMAd7O0--55i2FjhQZQkBL80kk0EDvMSRyddJhYfvyUAi0Q/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzVVUizs0mk_GCbYdht9s1pMAd7O0--55i2FjhQZQkBL80kk0EDvMSRyddJhYfvyUAi0Q/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzVVUizs0mk_GCbYdht9s1pMAd7O0--55i2FjhQZQkBL80kk0EDvMSRyddJhYfvyUAi0Q/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">서울시 대기환경 통합 정보</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><b></b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>이전에 올린 글에 있던 </b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>2개의 웹앱(서울시 환경데이터, 중국 바람 데이터) 을 합쳐서&#160;</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>하나의 웹앱을 만들어 봅니다.</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">- 영재 학급수업때 api 활용하여 하나의 주제 내용의 웹앱을 각각 만들고,<br>그 중 서로 관련(상관)이 있는 데이터를 연결하는 웹앱 개발(과학 빅데이터 분석 활용) 수업을 하고 있습니다.<br></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>(빅데이터&#160;분석)&#160;중국발&#160;황사(미세먼지)&#160;바람&#160;역추적&#160;웹앱&#160;(서울시API+기상청API&#160;활용)</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0a5f78cd71fd3663d0afd9bce1de62218d8f8ed\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0a5f78cd71fd3663d0afd9bce1de62218d8f8ed\" data-origin-width=\"738\" data-origin-height=\"696\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>특정날짜, 시각을 선택하면 </b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>그 시각의 서울의 환경수치가 나오고,</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><span style=\"color: #2c3e50;\">6시간 전 서해상 및 보하이만 일대의 바람 </span></b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><span style=\"color: #2c3e50;\">12시간 전 중국 산둥반도와 동해안 지역의 고농도 미세먼지가 포함된 기류</span></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><span style=\"color: #2c3e50;\">24시간 전 중국 베이징 및 허베이성 등 주요 산업지대 바람</span></b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><span style=\"color: #2c3e50;\">48시간 전 몽골 고비사막 및 내몽골 자치구 바람을</span></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><span style=\"color: #2c3e50;\">바로 확인할 수 있는 웹앱 입니다.</span></b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
